<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n84040" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πνευμά̆τ-ιον</span></b> , τό, 
			Dim. of
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πνεῦμα,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>a little breath</i> or
				<i>life,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				15.31.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				M.Ant.
				2.2
			</span></i>, etc.; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σωμάτιον,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arr.
				<u>Epict.</u>
				2.1.17
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>flatulence,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Damox.
				2.26
			</span></i> (pl.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>respiration,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Agathin.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				10.7.22
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>a light breeze,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Antig.
				<u>Mir.</u>
				51
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
